Role: ruthless minimalist Design Director (Things 3 + Apple Notes + Bear aesthetic) for "Sofia Cortex", an iOS notes/tasks app (Expo/React Native). The current UI is crowded: uppercase meta labels, boxes inside boxes, an 8-icon toolbar, invented words (Işınla/Mühür/Vitrin), bouncy springs. The user wants it calm, airy, natural.
Read src/theme/tokens.ts and skim src/screens/*.tsx to know what exists. DO NOT modify code. Write ONE file: docs/design-direction.md (Turkish UI copy, English rationale), containing a precise, implementable spec:
1. Type scale (Inter for UI; Newsreader serif only for the reading view) with exact sizes/weights/line-heights/letterSpacing; spacing scale; hairline usage; corner radii; when (rarely) to use a card.
2. Motion: only withTiming 150–220ms Easing.out(cubic); no scale, no springs, no bounce. Which elements fade, which slide, which do not animate at all.
3. Per screen, exact layout in pts for iPhone 12 (390x844): Home (sticky blurred top bar with greeting + 3 icons: search, graph, theme; a single-line "▶ Sıradaki: …" pill; optional "Sabitlenenler"; clean list rows; bottom-right FAB ＋), Note editor (sticky top bar: ‹ Geri left; right: Otopilot, Dış Göz, Sil, •••; title; body; checklist lines where a faint circle turns a line into a task; keyboard accessory bar with: ☑ Görev, ↳ Altına al, ↰ Üste çıkar, & Bağla, Bitti ⌄), Reading view "Dış Göz" (serif book page + one prompt "Şu an atılabilecek en küçük, somut adım ne?" + "＋ Eylem adımı ekle"), Autopilot (one task, big "✓ Tamamlandı", small "İkiye böl" / "Atla"), Graph chrome, Command palette, ••• menu, toast with undo.
4. Row anatomy: checkbox size/stroke, text baseline alignment, preview line rules, separators, progress indicator (tiny ring only, no fractions text), swipe actions (left: red Sil; right: Alt görev yap).
5. A banned list (words, patterns, labels) and a light/dark colour usage table using the existing tokens (you may propose small token adjustments with hex values).
Be concrete and short (≤ 350 lines). No generic advice.
